   "steps": [
    "$f(x)=x^{1/2}$.",
    "$f'(x)=\\dfrac12x^{-1/2}=\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}$.",
    "$f'(2)=\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$."
   ],
