   "correct": "$u=2x+1$, $v=3x^2+6$, $u'=2$, $v'=6x$. $f'=u'v+uv'=2(3x^2+6)+(2x+1)(6x)=6x^2+12+12x^2+6x=18x^2+6x+12$.",
   "steps": [
    "$u'v=2(3x^{2}+6)=6x^{2}+12$.",
    "$uv'=(2x+1)\\cdot6x=12x^{2}+6x$.",
    "Soma: $18x^{2}+6x+12$."
